<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   42.20		 42.30</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	68.90		 69.00</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 24.45		 24.50</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.360		 0.362</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.21		 11.23</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.47		 11.49</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.07		  1.09</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 3.90 pct	    4.30 pct</p>
</text>
